  "contentHtml": "<p>별거 아니지만..... 공유해봅니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생들이 완성한 사진은... 아쉽게도 없어서 제가 그냥 대충 만들어 보았습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>단원 마무리나 방학식 전에 총 정리 용도로 사용하셔도 좋고 형성평가로 사용하셔도 좋을 듯 합니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc017f3fe37c2579aa063b7a1b8aaf3075e48b0a\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc017f3fe37c2579aa063b7a1b8aaf3075e48b0a\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68a569172b5383673cdae15b993513a982f610b3\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68a569172b5383673cdae15b993513a982f610b3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebdcae8eeda826486bc0e83e1fb71e062dd4ab57\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebdcae8eeda826486bc0e83e1fb71e062dd4ab57\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0b3441500b42d58a9acfdc6dc86267f543e0595c\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0b3441500b42d58a9acfdc6dc86267f543e0595c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88a815a68f799e63c0542aea432fb048375bbbfa\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:33.34%; margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88a815a68f799e63c0542aea432fb048375bbbfa\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div